 <name>File_Therion</name>
 <channel>pear.php.net</channel>
 <summary>File_Therion provides an object oriented interface to Therions .th cave-data files.</summary>
 <description>File_Therion provides object oriented interface for parsing, handling and writing Therion (http://therion.speleo.sk/) cave survey data files (*.th).
        It features Therions data model as PHP objects and can be used to interface between therion data files, various databases and PHP based user applications.</description>
